{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0143_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1676968c88df59a5bff3b0cbac6b46284bcbb8a966b2efefb3bddc7a029392a7", "ja": "（今日は忙しかった……すっかり遅くなっちゃったな。\n明日もあるんだし、早く帰らないと）", "zh": "（今天真忙……不知不觉已经这么晚了。明天也还有工作，得赶紧回去了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0143_1001_008tak", "source_sha256": "3856b1e9e2c7befbd44f7a8adf63f38c867959a932c8e8570a1ce596ccff6ddc", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}。\n今までお仕事ですか？", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}。\n到现在都还在工作吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0143_1002_p", "source_sha256": "6225ba7bbcb23ef28b778d5b9fd87e372d40fdc01ae4c82a47038d223b0887a2", "ja": "あれっ、貴音！？\nどうしたんだ、こんな時間まで……。", "zh": "咦，贵音！？\n怎么了，这么晚还……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0143_1003_008tak", "source_sha256": "9e445cbcee903dcadf80f7fdc7a9d62d340107b4ed1c79d036f98ffc679bc514", "ja": "いいえ。私は、貴音ではありません。", "zh": "不，我不是贵音。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0143_1004_p", "source_sha256": "f9f92af3cc8e0b15c7513583b6d63df4e07409c6280dca696d5f913489d86f55", "ja": "え、何……？", "zh": "咦，什么……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0143_1005_008tak", "source_sha256": "5f9860e0bef9cc6570392a0012120628b763d8f2305495da8a079c6e24de17f9", "ja": "今の私は、都会の闇を貫く気高き光……。\nそう……怪盗ノーブルメロディです！", "zh": "现在的我，是贯穿都市黑暗的高贵之光……\n没错……就是怪盗高雅旋律！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0143_1006_p", "source_sha256": "31f2d9454e6119c37a9d313323b7d5fb7de0e186429fd5d4c3787b0d0ad743f2", "ja": "それって……ああ、前やった仕事のキャラだったっけ。\n今度はいったい、何を盗みにきたんだ？", "zh": "那个……啊，是之前工作时扮演的角色吧。这次到底是来偷什么的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0143_1007_008tak", "source_sha256": "15ad18702342f196fad2bc3e90675af7113b4eef571376fb9570494c32790d5e", "ja": "ふふっ……以前は、あなた様との時間を\nいただきましたね。今宵、私が狙うものは……", "zh": "呵呵……之前，我曾得到过与您共度的时光呢。今夜，我所瞄准的东西是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0143_1008_008tak", "source_sha256": "65fcf7a44fd0289a39362733590b074b764ec734993eb0594a41903bfacb54d6", "ja": "あなた様の、疲れです。", "zh": "就是您身上的，疲惫。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0143_1009_p", "source_sha256": "8b293b819b5a86cf713bc0411fb162077e74c3b51923ce4ed9f8c0e673dc5e21", "ja": "俺の、疲れ？", "zh": "是我的疲劳？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0143_1010_008tak", "source_sha256": "53f60149ab24aa4b2940a7186ccfdeb733cad8996880d1cbc07d9ae1fc1caebf", "ja": "{$P$}、お忙しいのは\nわかっておりますが、根を詰めすぎてはいけません。", "zh": "{$P$}，我知道您很忙，但也不能太过劳累。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0143_1011_008tak", "source_sha256": "c134a83759ef630523ef52c4e40d36a9127be70fb410daafd607db80bd381b86", "ja": "せめて、仕事の後くらいは、\nりらっくすしていただきたいのです……。", "zh": "至少，也请您在工作结束后放松一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0143_1012_p", "source_sha256": "794023ae09bec91ca79262e75e8878a34c8fc81adf207eead954a263f59fd48f", "ja": "なるほど……その気持ちはありがたいけど。\nそんなもの、どうやって盗むんだ？", "zh": "原来如此……你的心意我很感谢。不过，那种东西要怎么偷啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0143_1013_008tak", "source_sha256": "a3d749bdc6e4ef54335d1189986b9811c201fd31c5cc89868a34664e736c660b", "ja": "はい。よろしければ、共に夕食に参りましょう。\nおすすめのお店があるのです。", "zh": "好的。如果您愿意的话，就和我一起去吃晚餐吧。\n我知道一家值得推荐的店。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0143_1014_008tak", "source_sha256": "8549c58e56b03b22da056366d8466a0f310bc2d50b843ca8da3c1b73a5136285", "ja": "美味しいものを食べれば、\n仕事の疲れも、少しは癒えるかと……いかがですか？", "zh": "吃点美味的东西，工作积累的疲劳或许也能稍稍得到缓解……您觉得如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0143_1015_p", "source_sha256": "c09181894e0660aa15fabcea7881daa9bb8aec808673b0451dd3a8cbd41fafb4", "ja": "はは、そういう事か。\nよし、わかった！　一緒に行こう。", "zh": "哈哈，原来是这么回事啊。\n好，知道了！一起去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0143_1016_008tak", "source_sha256": "23bd5969ffedfba5967ff56c464d6909a08ea7aea74252b0cb92a2ad7da551b6", "ja": "はい。では参りましょう……あなた様。", "zh": "好的。那么，我们走吧……制作人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0143_1017_p", "source_sha256": "e01debd9580529732131e37c9aa96f4a2838b5287742dbf0ac9ec5a54939e8a6", "ja": "（なんだかもう、仕事の疲れを忘れてきた気がする。\nさすが怪盗、盗みの手口は鮮やかだな！）", "zh": "（总觉得已经渐渐忘记工作的疲劳了。真不愧是怪盗，盗窃手法真是干净利落啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
